stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active : createHold
    Active --> Confirmed : confirm before fixed expiry
    Active --> Released : explicit or detected abandonment; release succeeds
    Active --> Expired : fixed expiry or release pending
    state "Expired / release pending (EXPIRED)" as Expired
    Expired --> Released : transactional release succeeds
    Expired --> Expired : release failure; retry
    Confirmed --> [*]
    Released --> [*]
